@startuml
[*] --> EmptyFree : producer output

state "Empty Jar (isMarked=false)" as EmptyFree
state "Full Jar (isMarked=false)" as FullFree
state "Empty Jar (isMarked=true)" as EmptyLocked
state "Full Jar (isMarked=true)" as FullLocked

EmptyFree --> FullFree : POUR_IN
EmptyFree --> EmptyLocked : RESHAPE
EmptyFree --> EmptyLocked : MATCH

FullFree --> EmptyLocked : POUR_OUT
FullFree --> FullLocked : MATCH
FullFree --> EmptyLocked : RESHAPE_FULL

EmptyLocked --> [*] : round end
FullLocked --> [*] : round end

note right of EmptyFree
  POUR_IN: shape in base marks
  RESHAPE: can transform to target
  MATCH: matches order requirement
end note

note bottom of FullFree
  POUR_OUT: liquid not banned
  RESHAPE_FULL: can transform, liquid OK
  MATCH: matches order requirement
end note
@enduml